use uo;
use os;
use attributes;

// Equip script for restart_equip_strreq.
//
// It only does anything on startup, that is while the world file is being read back. The core has
// already decided the item is equippable by then -- part of which is that the wearer meets the
// item's StrRequired -- so dropping the wearer's strength here makes that answer stale before the
// item is actually put on. Approving the equip afterwards is the point: a script that refused
// would take a path the core has always handled.
program equip_weaken( equipped_on, item, startup, equipped_by )
  if ( startup )
    // in tenths, so this is a strength of 1 against the item's StrRequired of 50
    SetAttributeBaseValue( equipped_on, "Strength", 10 );
  endif
  return 1;
endprogram
